    "text": "Molecular orbital configuration of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> ( <math><mn>16</mn></math> electrons) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br />When an electron is added, it enters the <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math> orbital and the configuration becomes <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal